// Public values for the demo server, committed on purpose so the app runs right after cloning
// (decided on 23 Nov for the hand-in, see DECISIONS.md "Security").
// - The Supabase anon/publishable key is meant to be public: it can only do what the access rules
//   (RLS) in the database allow. The service role key is NEVER here.
// - The GIPHY key is a free key that only allows GIF searches.
// Config/Secrets.xcconfig (not in Git) overrides these values, for example for your own server.
// "//" starts a comment in xcconfig, so the URL is written with "/$()/".
SUPABASE_URL = https:/$()/awcuknlajkywifxquhcq.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = sb_publishable_VjjWWwc7HvycIXOV_xxhaQ_Xg2Wgy1L
GIPHY_API_KEY = pVndKDGjCWS89yKhuJfpFOTP8eTM9uqk
